# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
# Format: <from> <to> <status>, one rule per line, first match wins.

# "About the Lab" became "Who We Are" on 2026-08-07, and the URL moved with it.
# Both forms are listed because the splat rule only matches paths that already
# have the trailing slash.
/about-the-lab    /who-we-are/         301
/about-the-lab/*  /who-we-are/:splat   301
